  "whatIsThis": {
    "intro": "A freestyle frame in T700 carbon, in two sizes: 3-inch (141 mm wheelbase) and 5-inch (226 mm). The stack mounts in the middle, the motors at the arm tips, and the camera between two CNC aluminium side plates at the front. Soft TPU mounts hold the camera and the air unit, and TPU boots protect the arm tips. Incutec prints the TPU parts itself. They are preliminary: they fit the DJI O4 Pro only today, and other video systems are not supported yet. A stiff frame vibrates less, which gives the flight controller a cleaner gyro signal. The 20 × 20 OpenFC Lite and OpenESC fit both sizes. The 30 × 30 versions fit the 5-inch frame only.",
    "needs": [
      "A flight controller and ESC stack bolted in the middle",
      "Four motors and props at the arm tips",
      "A receiver, camera and VTX",
      "A LiPo and a battery strap",
      "A radio and goggles on the ground"
    ],
    "fit": "Everything else bolts onto it.",
    "chain": "frame",
    "hero": "T700 carbon. Holds the stack, motors and camera, and takes the crashes."
  },
